<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  mutation-sweep: finish the corpus mutation baseline overnight.

  TEMPORARY, NOT PART OF THE STANDING SET. This is deliberately absent from install.sh's
  PLISTS array so a routine `install.sh` never resurrects it. As of 2026-09-01 it drives
  the FROM-SCRATCH re-sweep of all 108 auditable tools (10,811 mutants) that the
  2026-08-31 PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE fix made necessary - every pre-fix number may be a
  false kill. Unload it once the sweep reports SWEEP COMPLETE:
      launchctl unload ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.nickmagnuson.jobsearch.mutation-sweep.plist
      rm ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.nickmagnuson.jobsearch.mutation-sweep.plist

  18:00, NOT 16:00 (moved 2026-09-01). While this runs, one tools/*.py is mutated on disk
  at any instant and the tree is unsafe for ordinary work - tests/conftest.py refuses to
  run, and skills that shell out to tools/*.py would execute a mutant against real data.
  A 16:00 start put that inside a working afternoon. 18:00 is after the workday, and the
  run is long enough (~10h at the 2026-08 rate) that it wants the whole night anyway.

  IT RECURS UNTIL UNLOADED, AND THAT IS SAFE. mutation_sweep resumes by tool name against
  baseline.jsonl, so a second 18:00 fire finds 0 unbanked tools and exits in seconds. The
  cost of forgetting is noise in the log, not a re-run.

  CAFFEINATE. The run is ~7 hours. Without -is the Mac idle-sleeps partway and the sweep
  is suspended mid-tool, which strands a .mutation_backup and makes the next run refuse
  at conftest. -i blocks idle sleep, -s blocks system sleep while on AC power.

  LOG FILES: never create, touch, or truncate anything in tools/launchd/logs/ from a Claude
  Code Bash call - files created that way inherit a com.apple.provenance xattr that launchd
  cannot open, and the job dies at EX_CONFIG (78) before the script runs, logging nothing.
  Rotation must DELETE and let launchd recreate. See reference_launchd_ex_config_provenance_xattr.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.nickmagnuson.jobsearch.mutation-sweep</string>
    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/bin/bash</string>
        <string>-lc</string>
        <string>cd "$HOME/Documents/Obsidian/30-projects/job-search" &amp;&amp; PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8 /usr/bin/caffeinate -is /opt/homebrew/bin/python3 tools/mutation_sweep.py</string>
    </array>
    <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
    <dict>
        <key>Hour</key><integer>22</integer>
        <key>Minute</key><integer>0</integer>
    </dict>
    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/mag/Documents/Obsidian/30-projects/job-search/tools/launchd/logs/mutation-sweep.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/mag/Documents/Obsidian/30-projects/job-search/tools/launchd/logs/mutation-sweep.err</string>
    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <false/>
</dict>
</plist>
